    "These attempts did not reach the native quote-read/receipt branch. In attempt03 all nine responses were CLOCK and all nine native clock candidates were rejected before SymbolInfoTick or CoReceipt could execute under the pinned host code. This measures the local clock-handshake path, not broker quote lag; it makes no finding that broker quotes were stale or fresh."
